/**
 * Characters exported from Xenoblight Sprite Forge (approved assets only). GENERATED by the forge script
 * scripts/export_game_characters.mjs on 2026-11-20 - do not edit by hand; re-export instead.
 *
 *   static: 4 x 2 sheet, 64 x 64 frames, order S SE E NE / N NW W SW (CharacterSheetLayout)
 *   walk:   6 x 8 sheet, 64 x 64 frames, rows S SE E NE N NW W SW, 6 frames per direction, 125 ms (CHARACTER_WALK_LAYOUT)
 *
 * Bald has no hair colour: its sheets are registered under hair colour "none" and, as aliases, under every
 * catalog hair colour, so selecting Bald with any colour shows the same art.
 * "mohawk" in the game catalog is the Sprite Forge "spike" hairstyle (blonde = forge blonde).
 */
